re gonna be rolled out  and I am now thinking of YouTube as  bonus money to the extent that it exists  and not really part of our key revenue  streams and a lot of these changes will  start over the next month  to different parts of the show long-form  videos that we've been dabbling with are  now going to become a more formal part  of the program the response to them has  been overwhelmingly positive  and some have been published to YouTube  over the vacation but we'll be running  on the broadcast show over the next  couple of weeks really good pieces on  classical liberalism and voter fraud  voter suppression political violence  socialism and we're also going to be  restructuring a lot of aspects of  membership and patreon on the membership  side we will be restarting supporter  only events supporter member only live  streams we are also going to be  launching $1 a trial membership which  will go a week and remember I believe  membership is so great that if people  tried it  most of them would stick with it so  we're gonna be looking at rolling out a  $1 one-week trial membership after which  you can either bail on the entire thing  or subscribe I believe most people will  subscribe and the audience has also  spoken on patreon rewards and goals  okay rewards and goals so we are in the  next again in the next three to four  weeks we will be instituting a number of  new patreon goals the current goal is  2,000 patrons and we've already got  goals set up for 3,000 and 4,000 patrons  for patreon only content but we're also  going to be loading up some rewards for  patrons and by popular demand we are  going to be having the bonus show  accessible to patrons at a certain level  at patreon.com slash david pakman show  we will have the full broadcast show  available to patrons at a certain  contribution level we are going to have  some supporter only monthly live streams  that will bring together members and  patrons we are going to have different  perks that will be available at  different levels of membership and  patreon so there's a lot of different  stuff that's going to be going on  tomorrow we've got a new membership  giveaway coming to us thanks to a viewer  named Patrick more on that tomorrow  we've got a couple new advertisers  coming on board so really a lot going on  and the the underlying reason is that  YouTube is basically done for us as a  revenue source the upside is a lot of  great stuff happening for you and  more about that upcoming in the next few  weeks
 

